.TH EIC\-RUN 1 "2026-10-22" "ec2-instance-connect-rh 0.0.1"
.SH NAME
eic\-run \- AuthorizedKeysCommand entry point for EC2 Instance Connect
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B eic\-run
.I username
.RI [ fingerprint ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B eic\-run
is invoked by
.BR sshd (8)
as an
.B AuthorizedKeysCommand
helper.
It validates the username, then launches
.B eic\-curl
as a subprocess with a 5\-second timeout.
.PP
The command is not intended to be run interactively.
It is configured via the sshd drop\-in at
.IR /etc/ssh/sshd_config.d/60\-ec2\-instance\-connect.conf .
.SH EXIT CODES
.TP
.B 0
Keys printed to stdout, or soft skip (missing user, non\-EC2 instance).
.TP
.B 1
Validation or trust\-chain failure.
.TP
.B 124
Subprocess timed out (5 seconds).
.TP
.B 255
IMDS/protocol error, or no valid keys found.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR eic\-curl (1),
.BR eic\-parse (1),
.BR sshd (8),
.BR sshd_config (5)
